msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫He stormed through the forest, and eventually, the mansion appeared before him"
"—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫like the world fading into view after a dream. ⟪k:6⟫Bestia was a tempest in the night, "
"blowing through the overgrowth toward the house."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ele adentrou a floresta e, eventualmente, a mansão apareceu diante dele—⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫como o mundo desaparecendo depois de um sonho. ⟪k:6⟫Bestia era uma tempestade na noite, "
"soprando através do mato em direção à casa."

